diagram theme: light background: #fcfcfc text: (color: #0a0a0a)
default node text: (size: 18) fill: #fcfcfc border: #95959d
default edge line: #55555c line: (path: curved)
style dim text: (color: #55555c)

node model "Language model" icon: cube 
node call "Proposed tool / + arguments" shape: document right of model
node guard "Application / validation" icon: cubes right of call
node tool "Business system" icon: desktop right of guard
edge model -> call
edge call -> guard
edge guard -> tool line: #6f3fb0
